			"notes": "It's sure been a while!\nThis release fixes some issues & changes the way the mod is used:\n- Fixed detection issues because of the new MCCI update & general issues it had\n- Added Rocket Spleef Rush support / tracking, the mod tracks these stats for rocket spleef:\n   -  Kills\n   - Deaths\n   - KDR\n   - Longest time alive\n   - Placement (Last placement & Average)\n- **Removed the mod libraries from being embedded into the mod!** to continue using the mod, you now must also install [YACL](https://modrinth.com/mod/yacl) and [Mod Menu](https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu) separately in order for the mod to work!\n\nTo install & use the mod now, you need to be on minecraft version 1.20.4, install the [Fabric Loader](https://fabricmc.net/use/installer/) installed for Minecraft Version **1.20.4**! \n(There is *no support* for 1.19.4 this time! unless people seem to want it),  the 0.97.0+1.20.4 or higher version of the [Fabric API](https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api), and both [YACL](https://modrinth.com/mod/yacl) and [Mod Menu](https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu) in their 1.20.4 supported versions in order for the mod to work!\n\nIf you have any other issues, report them through [Github Issues](https://github.com/danielml2/mcci-stats-tracker/issues)\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/danielml2/mcci-stats-tracker/compare/0.2.2...0.2.3"
		},
